"""
KMZ To DMT Generator  -  single-file Streamlit app.

Upload a KMZ from the XLSX-To-KMZ Generator and download a DeLorme Street Atlas
.dmt with four layers: AGMs, Access, Centerline, Notes.

AGM symbols follow the seed's AGM-type lookup: purple triangle (valves),
red flag (rebar) and blue dot (welds / tees / doors / etc.) -- each a custom
DeLorme draw symbol baked into the file.  Everything is embedded here; see
requirements.txt for the only dependency.
"""

